WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.416 --> 00:00:02.234
[Announcer] You love everything about Comic-Con.

2
00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:05.049
The superheroes, the cosplay, the awesome lines,

3
00:00:05.049 --> 00:00:06.195
but now there's a new convention

4
00:00:06.195 --> 00:00:09.723
that has all that minus the superheroes and the cosplay.

5
00:00:09.723 --> 00:00:12.075
It's Line-Con.
(audience laughing)

6
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:14.356
The ultimate convention for line superfans.

7
00:00:14.356 --> 00:00:15.521
From the moment you arrive,

8
00:00:15.521 --> 00:00:17.018
you'll be greeted with a check-in line.

9
00:00:17.018 --> 00:00:18.989
Then a line to collect your badge,

10
00:00:18.989 --> 00:00:21.031
then another line to get a program schedule,

11
00:00:21.031 --> 00:00:22.207
a line for your gift bag,

12
00:00:22.207 --> 00:00:23.817
and a line to get on the escalators

13
00:00:23.817 --> 00:00:25.523
to take you to the convention floor

14
00:00:25.523 --> 00:00:29.690
where you can wait in over 300 other lines.

15
00:00:29.723 --> 00:00:32.190
We've hired TSA officers to guarantee wait times

16
00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:35.815
of four hours and up or buy our VIP package

17
00:00:35.815 --> 00:00:38.055
and receive a not so fast pass

18
00:00:38.055 --> 00:00:40.982
that sends you directly to the back of every line.

19
00:00:40.982 --> 00:00:42.311
Sign up for a workshop

20
00:00:42.311 --> 00:00:44.398
and learn classic line standing techniques.

21
00:00:44.398 --> 00:00:47.784
Straight lines, curvy lines, lines with weird breaks in them

22
00:00:47.784 --> 00:00:50.684
plus there's the people who don't know where the line starts

23
00:00:50.684 --> 00:00:52.951
or catch a panel with people who have waited in line

24
00:00:52.951 --> 00:00:57.118 line:15%
for Hamilton, the cronut, every pair of new Jordans,

25
00:00:57.513 --> 00:01:00.077 line:15%
and a keynote with the inventor of the butterfly chair.

26
00:01:00.077 --> 00:01:01.624 line:15%
Plus, celebrity meet and greet

27
00:01:01.624 --> 00:01:04.439
with famed British line-master Dr. Queue.

28
00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:06.104
Don't get your panties wet ladies,

29
00:01:06.104 --> 00:01:09.606
there's only one restroom, and the line for it is huge.

30
00:01:09.606 --> 00:01:11.955
Plus, be sure to stay for the closing night party

31
00:01:11.955 --> 00:01:16.046 line:15%
where we'll create the world's largest human linetipede.

32
00:01:16.046 --> 00:01:17.975 line:15%
(audience groaning)

33
00:01:17.975 --> 00:01:19.962
It's Line-Con, tickets go on sale Monday.

34
00:01:19.962 --> 00:01:22.695
Lines forming now.
(audience applauds and cheers)

35
00:01:22.695 --> 00:01:24.076
I want in on that.

36
00:01:24.076 --> 00:01:26.576
I want in on that linetipede.

